<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-20942] conf-sanity test_73e, test_88a, test_250 fail against 2.17.0 servers</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20942</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;conf-sanity test_73e, test_88a and test_250 fail every time in interop testing against 2.17.0 servers (Test-Parameters serverversion=2.17), because they test server changes that landed after 2.17.0 and their version checks do not exclude 2.17.0:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;test_73e: "check client /mnt/lustre failed" after "Try to mount after MGS remount".  That part of the test was added with the server fix 089f438ba9a5 ("&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19692" title="MGS NID tables are lost after failover and need to be rebuilt" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-19692"&gt;LU-19692&lt;/a&gt; mgc: notify MGS about target NIDs after reconnect", v2_17_50-34), but the test only checks for MDS &amp;gt;= 2.16.57.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;test_88a: "test_88a returned 127", parsing the 2.17.0 tunefs.lustre output.  Added with 23b31c5db51a ("&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20360" title="tunefs.lustre silently ignores --mountfsoptions-only changes" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-20360"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-20360&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; utils: fix tunefs.lustre dropping mountfsoptions", v2_17_54-97), with no version check.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;test_250: "lcfg_erase did not list erased parameters".  Added with f5e198dc687a ("&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-18951" title="remove llog params records when erasing filesystem" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-18951"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-18951&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; utils: lctl lcfg_erase erase fsname params", v2_17_51-23), but checks for MGS &amp;gt;= 2.16.54.86.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Seen in every custom serverversion=2.17 conf-sanity session for 64202, 68474 and 66529, e.g. &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sessions/f8677e45-d2c9-48e2-9369-247f25ae08f5" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sessions/f8677e45-d2c9-48e2-9369-247f25ae08f5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
